        <mxCell id="dd-a1" value="&lt;b style=&#39;font-size:16px&#39;&gt;JobBoard — class diagram per domain (one bounded context = one microservice = one database)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&#39;color:#555555&#39;&gt;Inside a domain: real associations. Between domains: only ids, read through the owner&#39;s API (OpenFeign) or received in an event (RabbitMQ).&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=visible;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
