        <mxCell id="ac-a51" value="→ creates a Meeting &lt;b&gt;TO_SCHEDULE&lt;/b&gt; in meeting_db" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=visible;fontSize=10;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1150" y="222" width="250" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ac-a52" value="{&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &quot;eventId&quot;: &quot;7b1e…&quot;,&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &quot;type&quot;: &quot;ApplicationSubmitted&quot;,&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &quot;occurredAt&quot;: &quot;2026-10-12T09:15Z&quot;,&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &quot;applicationId&quot;: 6,&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &quot;candidateId&quot;: 4,&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &quot;jobId&quot;: 1&lt;br&gt;}" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=14;fillColor=#F7F7F9;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Courier New;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="450" width="230" height="190" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ac-a53" value="&lt;b&gt;Message (JSON)&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=visible;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="424" width="230" height="24" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ac-a54" value="&lt;b&gt;Design rules&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• The &lt;b&gt;producer owns the exchange&lt;/b&gt;; &lt;b&gt;each consumer owns its queue&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;br&gt;• candidature publishes &lt;b&gt;after the INSERT&lt;/b&gt; and never waits for the consumers.&lt;br&gt;• notification: manual ack, prefetch 10, &lt;b&gt;idempotent&lt;/b&gt; (remembers the eventIds already processed).&lt;br&gt;• A rejected message goes to &lt;i&gt;jobboard.events.dlx&lt;/i&gt; → &lt;i&gt;…dlq&lt;/i&gt; instead of being lost.&lt;br&gt;• Delivery is &lt;b&gt;at least once&lt;/b&gt;: the same message can arrive twice.&lt;br&gt;• If notification is stopped, messages wait in its queue: the candidate is not affected." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=14;fillColor=#FFFDE7;strokeColor=#BDB76B;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="740" width="640" height="170" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ac-a55" value="&lt;b&gt;Old version → new version&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Kafka topics (Application-topic, Meeting-topic) → &lt;b&gt;RabbitMQ&lt;/b&gt; exchange + queues.&lt;br&gt;• The broker is &lt;b&gt;infrastructure&lt;/b&gt;, not a microservice (it was “Micro service 5”).&lt;br&gt;• candidature no longer calls meeting synchronously: meeting &lt;b&gt;reacts to the event&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Going further&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Workshop 5: publish &lt;i&gt;ApplicationWithdrawn&lt;/i&gt; when an application is deleted.&lt;br&gt;• Evolution: meeting publishes &lt;i&gt;MeetingScheduled&lt;/i&gt; (key &lt;i&gt;meeting.scheduled&lt;/i&gt;) → notification sends the interview confirmation." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=14;fillColor=#FFFDE7;strokeColor=#BDB76B;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="720" y="740" width="700" height="170" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
  <diagram name="keycloak" id="kc">
